---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Teaching" description="Teaching experience and mathematical learning resources by John Rick Manzanares.">
  <header class="page-hero shell">
    <p class="kicker">Teaching</p>
    <h1>Learning mathematics by doing mathematics.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      My teaching materials emphasize explicit definitions, guided reasoning, computation where it clarifies
      ideas, and exercises that move from accessible questions toward genuine mathematical challenge.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">Experience</p>
          <h2>Courses and teaching work</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Selected university teaching, exercise classes, and curriculum work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <article class="timeline-card">
          <time>February–July 2025</time>
          <h3>University of Warsaw · Introduction to Topological Data Analysis</h3>
          <p>
            Exercise classes with guided theoretical and computational problems, including preparation
            of exercise sheets and in-person problem-solving sessions.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="timeline-card">
          <time>2021–2022</time>
          <h3>University of the Philippines Baguio</h3>
          <p>
            Teaching Associate for Elementary Analysis II and Introduction to Calculus; module writing
            and revision for Elementary Analysis I; and a bridging-program lecture for students preparing
            for Algebraic Structures I.
          </p>
          <div class="inline-links">
            <a href="/assets/Bridging-Program-Presentation.pdf">Bridging lecture →</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">Resources</p>
          <h2>Notes and presentations</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          This section will grow into a home for polished mathematical notes and reusable exercise material.
          Older teaching presentations remain available while newer resources are being reorganised.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="software-grid">
        <article class="software-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Algebra</p>
          <h2>Group Theory</h2>
          <p>A lecture presentation introducing core ideas from group theory.</p>
          <div class="inline-links"><a href="/assets/group_theory_presentation.pdf">Presentation →</a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="software-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Topological data analysis</p>
          <h2>Exercise Bank</h2>
          <p>
            A developing collection of theoretical and computational exercises intended to be answerable
            across a broad range of mathematical backgrounds.
          </p>
          <div class="inline-links"><a href="/notes/">Related notes →</a></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
